From: apklayer <noreply@apklayer.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] apklayer patch: heavy loop-region fuzz tests and BERBERIS_HEAVY_DUMP

Diagnostics for the pass that 0081 turns off: LoopRegions / LoopRegionsSimd compare heavy against the interpreter on generated
backward-branch loops (x9 counter, bases x1-x3; 500k integer cases, 0 diverged; SIMD only NaN-sign diffs), interpreter guard
raised to 4096 steps. BERBERIS_HEAVY_DUMP=<file> appends each heavy region ("pc count words...") after code generation, to
replay a game's regions in a test. Modules berberis_heavy_optimizer tests, libberberis_heavy_optimizer_arm64.

